    "representation": "lean4-declaration",
    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem grimm_conjecture (n k : ℕ) (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hk : 1 ≤ k)\n    (h : ∀ i : Fin k, (n + i).Composite) :\n    ∃ ps : Fin k ↪ ℕ,  ∀ i : Fin k, (ps i).Prime ∧ ps i ∣ (n + i)",
